from 1.2.4
The peripheral addresses specified in this document are legacy master addresses
and are visible to the ARM at 0x0_FEnn_nnnn if Low Peripheral mode is enabled.


Mailbox is to help with comms between ARM and GPU
starts from 0xb880
msg buffer must be 16 byte aligned 
28 bits for address and 4 bits for channel
https://jsandler18.github.io/extra/mailbox.html
https://jsandler18.github.io/extra/prop-channel.html
